# Averaged confinement in the near-axis QA model: the stage-one enclosures

The stage-one enclosures `S3pos`, `S3neg` of `amp 3/q` (one per sign of `σ`, `214`-term
polynomials with ball coefficients) and their checks `S3pos_eq`, `S3neg_eq` against
`stage1 cellMask amp3Lit (globalS ±1)`. A separate module, so that these kernel evaluations run
in their own process (see `Design/NearAxisQAAveraged`).
